 /* The callee of the split pure-call benchmark (WS-A1, ADR-264), in its
    own compilation unit. The caller's optimizer never sees this body,
    so the promise the compiler infers here can only reach the caller
    through the definition's attributes — which is what the measurement
    prices. The body is the same as the same-unit benchmark's helper,
    so the two measurements differ only in where the callee lives. */
 pure_helper: procedure(x) returns(fixed bin(31));
   declare x fixed bin(31);
   declare y fixed bin(31);
   y = x * 3 + 1;
   return(y);
 end pure_helper;
